== Documented changes ==
=== Fixes ===
* Fixed an issue where {{P|Berkano}} locusts could persist when used with {{I|Glowing Hourglass}}.
* Fixed an issue causing {{I|The Stairway}}, {{I|Card Reading}}, and {{I|Isaac's Tomb}} to not function properly.
* Fixed an issue where the {{T|Karma}} trinket could show up in daily runs and challenges if the trinket pool was depleted.
* Fixed an issue where force quitting a daily run would not reset the win streak counter.
* Fixed an issue where the {{M|Shop Restock Machine}} would still double reroll if destroyed via coins instead of bombs.
* Modding API fixes.
* Fixed inventory font.

== Undocumented changes ==
=== Changes ===
* The closing game pop-up now says "Are you sure you want me to die?" instead of "Are you sure you want to quit?".
* {{p|Rune Shard}}'s Berkano now gives one {{i|Abyss}} locust for the room.

